# design-lint baseline. Counts only go down: `make lint` lowers them.
# Raising one needs `make lint-rebaseline`, DESIGN_LINT_ALLOW_RAISE=1 on push, and a PR note.
version 1
format on
font-size 3
padding-literal 3
spacing-literal 3
radius-literal 0
hex-color 0
raw-color 0
raw-control off AppKit implements the kit controls
file-length 1
try-bang 0
force-cast 0
force-unwrap 1
print 0
opacity-literal 9
frame-literal 0
chamfer-literal 0
motion-literal 2
